          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "The webhook holds the key \"signingSecret\", a signing secret written into the file. The value is not shown; name the secret by a reference in secretRef instead. Fix: Remove the value from the file and from the history of the repository, treat it as exposed and replace it, and name the webhook secret by a reference such as env:CHECKOUT_WEBHOOK_SECRET."
          },
