          "ruleIndex": 9,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Asset USDC on solana marks an invoice paid at the confirmed commitment. A confirmed block has the votes of a supermajority of the stake but is not yet finalized; the Solana page on confirmation says only the finalized level takes away the risk of a dropped fork. Fix: Mark a Solana invoice paid at the finalized commitment, which the page on confirmation says removes the risk of a dropped fork, or record why confirmed is enough for the amounts the asset takes."
          },
