          "ruleIndex": 20,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "The underpaymentTolerance of the invoice is negative, so no underpayment tolerance is defined and an exact payment may fall outside it. This is a best practice of this tool, not a rule in the pages it cites. Fix: Give an underpaymentTolerance and an overpaymentTolerance in percent, from 0, and say what the checkout does with a payment outside them."
          },
          "locations": [
